So far I have 3 characters on 3 different servers.<P>Ghall 7th level Viking Healer - Gawain<BR>Ghall 7th level Troll Shaman - Bors<BR>Kruikan 6th level Lurikeen Nightshade - Galahad<P>So far I like the game but it's definatly not an EQ killer.  Don't get me wrong I like it and I like a lot about the game, but it IS a new game and EQ is a well established game that has quite a few things going for it.  One of those things is PLENTY of information.  Having info about your game is VERY important to enjoying it (at least that's the way I feel)  DAoC is decidedly lacking in this area.  There are MANY MANY hidden or undocumented features and some rather annoying bugs.<P>One other annoyance is the conning system.  In one battle you can wipe the floor with a blue con MOB and the VERY next fight with the EXACT same con and MOB you get your ass handed to you.  Pathing is kinda buggy but that's to be expected.  In fact all of these bugs should, hopefully, get fixed in the near future.<P>Good things about it:<BR>1. You can easily see what buffs are on your team mates (as long as someone doesn't ding or zone ... yes there are zones)<BR>2. You can see your teammates MANA level (This alone RoX0rz)<BR>3. You CAN solo and still advance in this game!!!<BR>4. Gettin around is pretty easy, even without using horses.<BR>5. Graphics KICK ass<BR>6. Spell effects are pretty and damn cool looking<BR>7. You automatically get spells (no searching for the correct vendors)<BR>8. Quests are dynamic and fairly unique.<BR>9. It's not EQ  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P><BR>Bad things:<BR>1. Spell icon bugs<BR>2. Difficult to figure out the commo panels<BR>3. Spell graphic bugs (seeing spell effects through objects that should block the effects)<BR>4. Conning system needs some work<BR>5. Starting screens don't size correctly when running your desktop at more that 800x600<BR>6. Skills system is VERY VERY crytpic<BR>7. Armor and weapons degrade and become obsolete too quickly.  You end up spend all your hard earned silver and copper (haven't made a gold yet) on armor and weapon upgrades.<BR>8. Quests are a little obtuse.<BR>9. It's not EQ  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>--------------------<P> <img src="http://people.mn.mediaone.net/raven13/images/Ghall.gif"> 
